Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.00,0:00:14.50,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Tonight, I send a salad.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.35,0:00:17.70,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I predict the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.22,0:00:19.85,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't it be funny if he actually goes like,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.85,0:00:21.77,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,"Hey, I am the Drift King here!"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.00,0:00:24.58,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And I crash an unreasonably priced car.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.93,0:00:26.85,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Definitely gotten used to the engine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.75,0:00:29.05,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Except for that moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:38.90,Music,,0,0,0,,♫The Allman Brothers Band - Jessica (Christian Henson arr.)♫
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.38,0:00:38.90,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}MeloriTensei's Forza Horizon 6 Stream Highlights (Part 2)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.90,0:00:43.43,Misc Speaker,,0,0,0,,RakuRaku Express: -customer here. They're attending the Festival so they want you to bring them their order-
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.60,0:00:43.58,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,"Show off and deliver!", excuse-moi?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.58,0:00:46.18,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of style points are you asking?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.18,0:00:48.40,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone's getting nausea at this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.40,0:00:50.20,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Including the food itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.10,0:00:52.32,Default Arial/Roboto (Original),,0,0,0,,{\c&HA4884E&\pos(960,350)\an5)}AutoPotato: mixing the food up\Nwith style!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.20,0:00:52.40,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,"mixing up the food with style!" Hell yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.40,0:00:55.82,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Maze-ro*, maze-ro*, mix it up, mix it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.82,0:00:57.28,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\an5\ytshake\pos(1408,864)} Hehahahahahahah
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.28,0:00:58.52,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\an5\ytshake\pos(1360,804)} Hehahahahahahah
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.32,0:00:59.23,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I blundered my Japanese >.<\N(It's maze*ru*! Not mazeRO)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.25,0:01:01.80,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\an5\ytshake\pos(1492,876)} Hehahahaha
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.08,0:01:03.45,Misc Speaker,,0,0,0,,Customer: I'm looking forward to this!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.85,0:01:04.72,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\an5\ytshake\pos(1436,812)} H-hahahahahaha
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.18,0:01:07.57,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\an5\ytshake\pos(1484,748)} NHhh-hahahahahaha
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.65,0:01:10.67,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh~ are we getting three stars of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.45,0:01:13.58,Misc Speaker,,0,0,0,,RakuRaku Express: Great! We have more orders ready if you want to take on another job?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.08,0:01:13.93,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\an5\ytshake\pos(1444,848)} Hahahahah
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.93,0:01:15.90,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,WE DO!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.90,0:01:18.13,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\an5\ytshake\pos(1432,760)} Hahahahahahah
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.13,0:01:20.00,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.08,0:01:23.25,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are we looking at?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.23,0:01:24.73,Hasegawa Mei,,0,0,0,,Mei: Hey, nice job. You earned yourself a promotion! Keep this up and you'll keep climbing the ranks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.88,0:01:25.35,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my god.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.23,0:01:28.27,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,"Obviously the devs havent seen the top gear special
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.27,0:01:30.30,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,in India where they deliver canned meals
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.30,0:01:32.57,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,which didn't stay in the car by the time it arrived..."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.90,0:01:33.37,Default Arial/Roboto (Original),,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H8359C2&}SunderB: Obviously the devs\Nhavent seen the top gear special in\NIndia where they deliver canned\Nmeals. which didnt stay in the can by\Nthe time it arrived...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.57,0:01:33.42,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.42,0:01:34.68,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,"hey i ordered noodles
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.68,0:01:35.92,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,why did i get a salad"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.92,0:01:37.95,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\an5\ytshake\pos(1356,824)}Hehehahahahahaha
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.37,0:01:39.47,Default Arial/Roboto (Original),,0,0,0,,{\c&HC45788&\an5\pos(960,350)}Aerostatikk (Mod): hey i ordered\Nnoodles why did i get a salad
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.82,0:01:41.72,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.92,0:01:45.55,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Here?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.55,0:01:46.07,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh wait no.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.07,0:01:47.30,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,It's just in front of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.30,0:01:48.47,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so blind.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.53,0:01:50.52,ANNA,,0,0,0,,ANNA: Turn left.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.15,0:01:52.13,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Where left?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.58,0:01:54.85,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my god, those tight streets-
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.85,0:01:56.82,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, we're not allowed in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.82,0:01:58.27,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Forza.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.53,0:02:00.33,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,You silly goose.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.57,0:02:01.77,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Forza, you silly goose.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.77,0:02:02.80,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,We're not allowed in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.80,0:02:03.88,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you see that there's a-
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.88,0:02:05.75,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,there's a no entry sign?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.58,0:02:08.10,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,That's a one-way road.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.43,0:02:08.55,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,400)\an5)}Actually, there's two
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.37,0:02:11.27,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,W-W-We're breaking all kinds of-
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.27,0:02:12.65,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,of traffic laws anyways, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.65,0:02:13.68,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know if that-
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.68,0:02:15.52,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think that matters anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.68,0:02:17.47,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, we've only got one star.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.47,0:02:18.18,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Dang it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.18,0:02:19.67,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.02,0:02:20.53,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Let's-
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.53,0:02:20.95,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Let's-
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.95,0:02:22.32,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hold it off for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.20,0:02:24.28,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, we can't just-
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.28,0:02:26.10,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,We can't just leave vehicles like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.88,0:02:28.85,ANNA,,0,0,0,,ANNA: You have arrived at your destination.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.05,0:02:28.92,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,"Kinkaku-ji Trail"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.15,0:02:29.90,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.33,0:02:32.35,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh dang, we had to drive that Lan. Evo.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.90,0:02:34.27,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And I forgot to upgrade it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.97,0:02:37.35,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,We need the top speed though.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.77,0:02:39.77,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,So we'll take that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.37,0:02:41.12,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.12,0:02:42.18,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! Still In Love!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.83,0:02:43.63,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.63,0:02:44.82,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\an5\ytshake\pos(1380,768)}Hehehehehehe
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.85,0:02:47.98,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,For those who have not played Uma Musume,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.98,0:02:50.32,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,she's the well-known yandere girl that-
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.67,0:02:50.93,Default Arial/Roboto (Original),,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H433AD8&}Still in Love: Aishiteru, aishiteru, aishiteru, aishiteru
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.32,0:02:52.68,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,that- that turns your whole screen red.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.93,0:02:53.02,Default Arial/Roboto (Original),,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H433AD8&\ytshake}Ah, hahahahahaha~
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.02,0:02:56.02,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}One boring race later...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.58,0:02:57.23,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hehehehe
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.23,0:02:59.53,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot I set that as my pose.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.53,0:03:01.03,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,That's- that's so T-pose-y
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.03,0:03:03.03,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,even though it- it isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.03,0:03:05.15,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,It's supposed to be a Gundam pose, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.15,0:03:05.52,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.52,0:03:06.28,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,No wait, no no no no.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.28,0:03:07.28,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Not Gundam, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.28,0:03:09.65,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Like, something that you find out of Tokusatsu's.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.65,0:03:11.88,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Um, Kamen Rider
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.88,0:03:14.90,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,or an American equivalent would be Power Rangers, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.35,0:03:20.67,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Ayyyy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.25,0:03:25.05,Helena Marston,,0,0,0,,Helena: You've qualified for your first Horizon Rush Event. Well done! Make your way there, complete the event and earn that Green Wristband.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.20,0:03:25.82,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.53,0:03:27.10,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.52,0:03:30.15,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if I can quick travel there now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.93,0:03:31.83,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,To save time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.08,0:03:33.28,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,No, we can't. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.28,0:03:34.97,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Welp, guess we're swapping cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.90,0:03:37.70,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Let's try this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.03,0:03:43.15,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, this is a pretty build.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.15,0:03:45.13,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I don't even need tuning for this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.13,0:03:45.58,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh~!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.12,0:03:47.82,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Holy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.82,0:03:49.37,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.37,0:03:50.87,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,This is one of those cars that- that
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.87,0:03:53.35,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,police can't ch- can't catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.57,0:03:54.87,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I would love to drift in this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.87,0:03:55.60,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Holy shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.02,0:03:57.95,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Like, we're talking real life and everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.48,0:04:00.23,Default Arial/Roboto (Original),,0,0,0,,{\an5\fad(1000,0)}Siututut~
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.63,0:04:01.98,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, did you hear that little-
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.98,0:04:02.88,Default Arial/Roboto (Original),,0,0,0,,{\an5\fad(1000,0)}Siutututu
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.88,0:04:04.38,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,It's not supposed to stututu,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.38,0:04:06.15,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,but there's like a little bit of whistling.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.15,0:04:07.48,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,There's a little bit of whistling.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.70,0:04:09.17,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,When I said it's not supposed to stututu,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.17,0:04:10.30,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,because it's not a Subaru!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.30,0:04:12.23,Default Arial/Roboto (Original),,0,0,0,,{\an5\move(-100,540,2050,540)}Stutututu
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.32,0:04:13.35,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,It's not a Subaru,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.35,0:04:15.13,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,so therefore it shouldn't stututu.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.13,0:04:18.63,Default Arial/Roboto (Original),,0,0,0,,{\an5\move(-100,540,2070,540)}Suuuuuuuuu~
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.68,0:04:20.53,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,But you hear a little bit of that whisper.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.62,0:04:21.92,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Not whisper, whistle.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.92,0:04:24.22,Default Arial/Roboto (Original),,0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H17FCCD&}Horizon {\c&HFFFFFF&}Presents\NPier Pressure
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.28,0:04:27.47,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,"Pier" Pre- I hate- I hate that chapter name.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.72,0:04:29.32,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I hate that chapter name.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.58,0:04:30.17,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,That-
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.32,0:04:32.35,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, God, just-
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.47,0:04:36.17,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we're doing Gymkhana, aren't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.68,0:04:38.40,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we're doing Gymkhana, alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.70,0:04:40.43,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,We're Gymkhana-ing in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.05,0:04:49.43,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, that totally is Gymkhana, alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.15,0:04:51.68,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wait. We're supposed to smash it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.68,0:04:52.40,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I'm an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.40,0:04:54.05,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know why I braked for.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.58,0:04:56.05,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, at least I'm doing way better than-
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.05,0:04:58.27,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,than- than Horizon 5, though, I gotta be honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.55,0:05:00.25,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.83,0:05:01.37,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.37,0:05:03.20,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\an5\ytshake\pos(1404,760)} Hehahahahahaha
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.87,0:05:05.67,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,"New Fast & Furious movie looks lit"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.67,0:05:06.90,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\an5\ytshake\pos(1400,852)} Ah, hahahaha
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.52,0:05:06.90,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}Previously on Forza Horizon 5:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.50,0:05:06.90,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HD6D2DB&\pos(960,350)\an5)}Tempest A. Exiom: New Fast & Furious movie looks lit
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.10,0:05:09.90,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Throughout the whole thing, despite with all the assist off.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.87,0:05:13.32,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I've definitely gotten used to the engine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.32,0:05:16.55,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Except for that moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.55,0:05:17.12,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I-
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.63,0:05:20.97,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I oversteered.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.43,0:05:27.17,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh~
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.38,0:05:28.18,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh~
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.43,0:05:29.32,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oooh~!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.38,0:05:31.35,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Wooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.52,0:05:33.07,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Wowee! Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.10,0:05:40.23,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it doesn't got that power to- to- to- to-
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.23,0:05:42.95,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,to let me slide over in a U-turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.33,0:05:47.53,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.53,0:05:48.38,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I missed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.58,0:05:49.50,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Go back a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.52,0:05:57.25,Default Arial/Roboto (Original),,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(779,288)}*Steam notification*
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.48,0:05:59.48,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,"Carkour!"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.48,0:06:00.72,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I hate that joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.72,0:06:02.70,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I hate that achievement.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.07,0:06:05.15,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,It says "Carkour!".
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.15,0:06:07.43,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,C-A-R-K-O-U-R.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.77,0:06:08.93,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,"Carkour!"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.93,0:06:09.80,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.13,0:06:10.68,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.68,0:06:11.07,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Hehehe
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.55,0:06:11.83,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Hehe
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.10,0:06:13.22,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.48,0:06:18.30,Helena Marston,,0,0,0,,Helena: Wear that new Wristband with pride! You earnt it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.82,0:06:18.37,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Pride? O.O
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.37,0:06:20.02,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Ssss- hehehehe
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.08,0:06:21.07,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry XD
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.02,0:06:21.07,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Happy Pride, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.18,0:06:26.18,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my god...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.23,0:06:27.15,Helena Marston,,0,0,0,,Helena: You know the drill: to qualify we have these new Events open to you. So, what takes your fancy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.48,0:06:28.63,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my god...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.62,0:06:30.77,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my god.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.60,0:06:32.83,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my god!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.58,0:06:35.88,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my god! They're unlocking everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.58,0:06:36.37,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,400)\an5)}Not really, there's more
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.12,0:06:39.33,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Something just hit me...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.33,0:06:41.28,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,What happens if we stopped here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.70,0:06:44.15,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,High octane, please~
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.33,0:06:46.13,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Hehehehe
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.72,0:06:47.52,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.18,0:06:53.77,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, dang it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.77,0:06:56.78,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Not- Not the power for me to slide forward
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.78,0:07:00.57,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,All on the inertia, nothing- nothing on- on- on power
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.70,0:07:04.87,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! I wasn't even looking at the map at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.87,0:07:07.70,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Railway Sprint... Cross-country... drift club!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.85,0:07:09.73,ANNA,,0,0,0,,ANNA: OK, Mallory. I have set-
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.22,0:07:09.73,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do a little bit of Drift Club.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.98,0:07:11.13,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,What car are we driving?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.13,0:07:12.58,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, not this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.58,0:07:14.73,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Let me change my damn car!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.73,0:07:15.78,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.25,0:07:17.40,Hasegawa Mei,,0,0,0,,Isamu: If you only ever drift-
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.78,0:07:17.40,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my god, it would not-
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.52,0:07:20.95,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I'm driving a shite box
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.63,0:07:22.95,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,What was that???
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.77,0:07:24.93,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,You can't-
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.82,0:07:27.28,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Xbox, I think I found a bug.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.28,0:07:28.00,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Hehehe...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.45,0:07:32.68,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,We've got wel- we've got bounc- bouncing fences
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.35,0:07:37.22,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, there's a whole lot of time but...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.50,0:07:38.37,Jordan Chambers,,0,0,0,,Jordan: That's just showing off...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.50,0:07:39.98,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, pffft...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.98,0:07:42.93,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Showin' off with WHAT??? With a shite box?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.35,0:07:53.27,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to get- get a grip here with this damn forsaken car
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.27,0:07:59.92,Jordan Chambers,,0,0,0,,Jordan: That's it! If you don't Drift with style, it's just skidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.63,0:08:02.40,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Am I not skidding at this point?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.40,0:08:04.33,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I'm literally skidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.42,0:08:06.98,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,There's virtually no difference from
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.98,0:08:09.90,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,whatever I call drift, and- and skidding
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.90,0:08:12.92,Jordan Chambers,,0,0,0,,Jordan: One of the greatest ever to do it, Keiichi Tsuchiya-san,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.92,0:08:14.58,Jordan Chambers,,0,0,0,,AKA The Drift King.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.43,0:08:16.82,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,(giggles)
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.82,0:08:17.62,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.58,0:08:21.10,Jordan Chambers,,0,0,0,,Imagine how wild it was, way back, when someone would lose traction on purpose in a normal race. Imagine!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.62,0:08:21.18,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I know he actually is called The Drift King but...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.18,0:08:23.25,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,what if RTGame Daniel,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.25,0:08:27.03,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,who claims himself as The Drift King of Mario Kart...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.92,0:08:29.22,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,what if he-
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.10,0:08:29.40,Hasegawa Mei,,0,0,0,,Isamu: Yes, he started in the street scene, just like what you are doing now. Street to Circuit just like The Drift King.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.22,0:08:30.97,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't it be funny if he actually goes like
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.97,0:08:32.93,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,"Hey, I AM The Drift King here"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.93,0:08:35.30,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,like imagine he says something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.87,0:08:38.88,Jordan Chambers,,0,0,0,,Jordan: One of the greatest ever to do it, Keiichi Tsuchiya-san,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.30,0:08:38.90,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HF54B8D&}RTGame: I think i need to focus on just getting to the end in time
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.88,0:08:40.55,Jordan Chambers,,0,0,0,,AKA The Drift King.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.65,0:08:41.60,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HF54B8D&}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.60,0:08:43.00,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HF54B8D&}What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.00,0:08:44.18,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HF54B8D&}Uhh, who is this imposter?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.53,0:08:46.53,Default Arial/Roboto (Original),,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,400)}*ding*
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.18,0:08:46.95,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HF54B8D&}I don't- I don't remember this guy back in college.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.30,0:08:46.95,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}Meanwhile in the RT Cinematic Universe:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.53,0:08:46.95,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,400)\an5)}She WAS right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.65,0:08:49.30,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I'm running out of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.05,0:08:51.17,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Welp.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.88,0:08:53.38,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,A-pffttttt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.67,0:08:57.20,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I just realized I ran out of time, gg...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.20,0:09:00.55,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh god, we should have gotten a better car.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.55,0:09:03.82,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh god, we actually have to drive this damned car?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.03,0:09:06.53,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, so we're not supposed to be drifting in theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.82,0:09:10.42,Jordan Chambers,,0,0,0,,Jordan: We're off to meet Hamada Isamu-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.53,0:09:10.42,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,At least what he says but- but the game wants us to- to defy him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.62,0:09:11.55,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh wait, not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.55,0:09:13.35,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,We have to get- we have to meet the guy first
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.47,0:09:14.87,Jordan Chambers,,0,0,0,,Jordan: The best part of Drift Club, aside from the drifting, is the community.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.35,0:09:14.87,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,before we start drifting
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.98,0:09:16.32,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Y'know what? Feck it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.17,0:09:21.28,Jordan Chambers,,0,0,0,,Jordan: Look at you go! Like some kind of car snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.82,0:09:22.70,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.27,0:09:24.00,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.00,0:09:24.43,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Hehe
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.43,0:09:24.98,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,(imitating) No, I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.43,0:09:25.05,Default Arial/Roboto (Original),,0,0,0,,{\an8}Kid: No I'm not
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.43,0:09:25.05,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}(9+10 = 21 Vine)
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.98,0:09:26.72,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Hehehehehehehehehe
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.27,0:09:34.23,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh dang, I was hoping for 200k but
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.23,0:09:36.97,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Isetta, aaaaaaa...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.97,0:09:39.22,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh well, the Isetta it is then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.22,0:09:40.28,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Let's try out different cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.28,0:09:41.27,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Now that-
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.48,0:09:44.10,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Let's try out this Lotus.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.10,0:09:45.82,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Let's try out this Lotus it's
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.82,0:09:49.15,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,It's, it's full of- oh... holy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.88,0:09:51.02,Default Arial/Roboto (Original),,0,0,0,,{\an8}Jeremy Clarkson: HAMMOOOOOOND!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.15,0:09:51.02,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,We almost Richard Hammond'ed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.08,0:09:53.43,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Wowie...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.22,0:09:58.53,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I'm still a big fan of the Rimac Concept Two, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.53,0:10:00.53,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Because the Concept One is
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.53,0:10:03.60,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,what Richard Hammond flipped ages ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.15,0:10:07.18,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh right, why have I been driving on my own for a while now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.18,0:10:08.72,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,We could- we could Auto Drive
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.72,0:10:10.38,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Hehehehehe
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.38,0:10:12.88,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot that there's Auto Drive
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.88,0:10:15.43,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,We've been playing for a very long time now
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.00,0:10:17.22,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Cinematic cam?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.22,0:10:20.40,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Wow... what the heck?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.48,0:10:22.77,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Hehehehehehe
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.77,0:10:24.17,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,What a sight of a car.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.17,0:10:25.17,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.08,0:10:28.13,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,That's crazy
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.83,0:10:39.35,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,That crack on the window (/ytshake)
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.35,0:10:42.12,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,That crack on the window is so funny
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.13,0:10:48.43,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I just realized the Auto Drive is really just lawfully driving
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.72,0:10:49.38,Default Arial/Roboto (Original),,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(936,667)}*bonk*
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.43,0:10:50.57,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Except for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.57,0:10:52.92,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I freaking just...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.92,0:10:54.63,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,How did I jinx it???
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.63,0:10:57.18,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,How the hell did I jinx it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.18,0:10:58.97,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\an5\ytshake\pos(1424,856)} Hahahahahaha
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.38,0:11:00.33,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\an5\ytshake\pos(1444,796)} Haha hhhhh
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.75,0:11:02.77,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.57,0:11:07.97,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,ow ow ow
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.05,0:11:13.47,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,but it is my forte to- (stuttering) turn-
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.47,0:11:15.13,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,-to swing people off
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.17,0:11:17.85,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Eugh
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.85,0:11:18.53,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Eu-gh
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.53,0:11:20.92,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I keep forgetting that this turn exists
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.30,0:11:22.68,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,There we go, first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.10,0:11:25.10,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Woo~!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.47,0:11:27.67,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,"Horizon Drift"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.18,0:11:32.00,Jordan Chambers,,0,0,0,,Jordan: In Drift, you'll be pitted against 11 other drivers across three Events. You'll want to hit as many drifts as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.27,0:11:32.00,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, shooooes....
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.22,0:11:34.45,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Eyyy
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.58,0:11:37.68,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,We're in on- we're online now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.68,0:11:39.23,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever find me,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.23,0:11:40.38,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,you can- you get- you-
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.38,0:11:41.33,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,get the battle-
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.22,0:11:43.22,Jordan Chambers,,0,0,0,,Jordan: Hey! Looks like we're well on our way to the next Horizon Showcase Event! I heard some rumours about what we might up against, and that mech in the Festival Site is starting to look really suspicious...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.33,0:11:43.22,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,battle the weakling of me
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.40,0:11:45.50,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,"Select your car"? What do you mean "Select your car"?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.50,0:11:49.13,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, oh, oh, oh, oh shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.05,0:11:52.23,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, oh no.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.63,0:11:55.95,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I've got none of the worky cars, uhh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.40,0:11:59.12,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I'll borrow that Subaru, holy shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.23,0:12:01.03,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, this is not gonna bode well for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.27,0:12:04.57,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh god, I'm the only one with a shitbox for sure
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.78,0:12:06.37,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,We're all in similar things
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.37,0:12:10.37,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Three laps of drift, earns the highest- highest drift score possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.90,0:12:13.53,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, the highest score in the lap!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.07,0:12:15.87,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,That's crazy
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.13,0:12:19.35,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,No wonder people are frantically just drifting in a spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.62,0:12:26.18,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.65,0:12:29.23,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't ov- don't over brake, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.78,0:12:33.05,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,That's the funniest sh- event ever and the funniest meta
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.50,0:12:35.60,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,that is to drift very slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.77,0:12:36.62,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Sorta
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.10,0:12:39.72,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Dang
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.73,0:12:43.33,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Ninth place
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.73,0:12:45.18,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I am terrible at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.18,0:12:45.82,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Ehehehe
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.22,0:12:48.92,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, at least we finished so that- that- that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.30,0:12:51.37,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,that's good, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.05,0:12:53.23,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Speed zones let's-
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.23,0:12:54.25,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,let's do the speed zones.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.25,0:12:56.50,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, can I teleport? No I cannot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.90,0:13:01.95,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,What cars do you think is the rarest car in Forza Horizon 6?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.40,0:13:03.83,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,"bugatti because they arent there"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.20,0:13:06.67,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh dang.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.15,0:13:06.93,ANNA,,0,0,0,,ANNA: Turn around when it is safe to do so.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.67,0:13:07.52,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, they wait-
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.52,0:13:09.67,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Do they really not have Bugattis anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.25,0:13:09.83,Default Arial/Roboto (Original),,0,0,0,,{\c&H6A4DD3&\pos(960,350)\an5)}gta4haterhq: bugatti because\Nthey arent there lol
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.15,0:13:14.62,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh wait, we're driving already.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.50,0:13:16.47,Jordan Chambers,,0,0,0,,Jordan: You're in a Speed Zone. Floor it to the end and don't leave the road!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.62,0:13:16.63,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Shite!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.45,0:13:20.23,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, sir, I fell off the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.42,0:13:21.42,Default Arial/Roboto (Original),,0,0,0,,{\c&H6A4DD3&\pos(960,300)\an5)}gta4haterhq: nope porsche sold\Ntheyre share of bugatti right before fh6\Nreleased
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.72,0:13:24.20,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,"porsche sold their share of bugatti right before Forza Horizon"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.65,0:13:27.52,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, that's why.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.13,0:13:45.77,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Try not to slide off too much
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.75,0:13:59.17,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Two stars...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.17,0:14:01.05,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Three stars! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.23,0:14:09.13,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Have you guys realized that this is the most Forza Horizon...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.23,0:14:12.15,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.15,0:14:14.98,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,road designs, outside of tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.52,0:14:19.85,Default Arial/Roboto (Original),,0,0,0,,{\an5}Danger Sign\N{\c&H1BFBF8&}Failed
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.63,0:14:20.25,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my god!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.25,0:14:21.83,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean it "failed"?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.83,0:14:22.70,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Wait... sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.70,0:14:24.42,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean it "failed"???
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.75,0:14:26.62,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,What bit of it was a failure?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.43,0:14:29.57,Jordan Chambers,,0,0,0,,Jordan: head back up, give it another shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.63,0:14:32.85,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,There, registered!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.85,0:14:34.57,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Freaking hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.88,0:14:37.63,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,We really knocked the front and then it goes "failed".
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.38,0:14:39.52,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,That was funny
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.33,0:14:42.87,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,That was real goofy of the game, honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.23,0:14:45.13,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,We can go from... here
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.72,0:14:47.50,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh wait, I just realized.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.50,0:14:49.77,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,You can fast travel from any location
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.77,0:14:51.77,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,provided you have been there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.03,0:14:53.85,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Now everything makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.40,0:14:58.40,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.18,0:15:00.00,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,How do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.75,0:15:02.90,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,How do we do? How do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.90,0:15:04.23,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Three stars!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.83,0:15:07.18,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,"Trailblazer Start Gate"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.18,0:15:09.67,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.67,0:15:11.52,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,i've never seen this before
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.52,0:15:12.85,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Trailb-
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.33,0:15:15.00,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Trackblazing or trailblazing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.00,0:15:16.82,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't looking properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.82,0:15:18.73,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,It does say "Trailblazer".
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.58,0:15:25.38,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.78,0:15:27.47,Jordan Chambers,,0,0,0,,Jordan: This is a Trailblazer. There's a start and end gate... but you'll need to figure out the middle part.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.50,0:15:30.68,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, go there yourself, basically.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.30,0:15:33.90,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.25,0:15:34.37,Jordan Chambers,,0,0,0,,Little hint, the fastest route is not necessarily from the following road. Focus up and use your navigational skills!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.93,0:15:35.92,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Nope!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.30,0:15:42.97,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,40 seconds to get there, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.27,0:15:45.42,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,That's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.35,0:15:47.20,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I made it
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.20,0:15:48.37,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,How many stars, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.20,0:15:50.90,Jordan Chambers,,0,0,0,,That trail? Blazed. Enjoy it? There'll be more to find with every new Wristband!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.25,0:15:54.37,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,That's two stars, only.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.37,0:15:58.68,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, what a big gamble to- to- to- to- to drive into trees
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.57,0:16:02.48,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,and then hit a bridge after that, what the heck.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.70,0:16:08.53,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,New personal best but I don't think that's three stars at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.88,0:16:10.30,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's two stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.75,0:16:13.32,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,ONE second faster to earn...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.50,0:16:20.90,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,That's another wall!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.72,0:16:23.87,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.98,0:16:28.55,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go! Three stars!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.62,0:16:31.62,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oooh~!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.08,0:16:33.08,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that was-
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.50,0:16:35.30,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh wow, that was intense, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.78,0:16:37.00,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,In the coming time, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.00,0:16:40.43,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I think I'm gonna progress a little bit of the insignificant parts
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.43,0:16:46.30,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,of the game, um, in the background, hopefully- hopefully off-stream
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.30,0:16:49.50,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,and then once we get to the major ones we'll-
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.50,0:16:51.03,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,we'll do all that on stream.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.03,0:16:53.68,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Um but if you do if you want to see more of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.68,0:16:55.07,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,let me know right now in the chat
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.07,0:16:56.33,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,or let me know right now in live chat
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.33,0:16:58.75,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,or write in the comments b- uh comments below
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.67,0:17:00.10,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Or in the comments of this highlight!\NI read :)
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.75,0:17:00.23,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,if you're watching from the VOD.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.23,0:17:02.48,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I do- I do hella enjoy the game if it-
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.05,0:17:05.82,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,if it means it entertains others while I'm-
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.82,0:17:07.62,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,while I'm suffering over-
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.62,0:17:09.65,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,over no assist at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.65,0:17:14.23,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Because my- my community knows how to make me suffer
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.23,0:17:18.20,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,by telling- by telling me to never have any form of assist.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.47,0:17:21.70,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, I've been playing without assist throughout the whole-
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.70,0:17:24.10,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,throughout the whole game because
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.10,0:17:27.23,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I've actually tr- wouldn't say "trained" but
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.23,0:17:29.00,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,tried adapting to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.33,0:17:30.93,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,"Please", "please more", all right, we'll-
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.00,0:17:32.50,Default Arial/Roboto (Original),,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,250)\c&H6A4DD3&}gta4haterhq: yes pls more\N{\c&HC45788&}Aerostatikk (Mod): need more\N{\c&HD06AB5&}vitoromega13: please more!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.93,0:17:32.73,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,we'll definitely do more then.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.73,0:17:37.50,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,But yeah, I've been playing without assist at all in Horizon 5 because
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.72,0:17:41.77,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I knew that there will be more demands for zero assist
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.90,0:17:49.18,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,"manual gearbox, no rewinds, realistic damage vs hardest ais", god!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.60,0:17:50.87,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Hehehehe
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.30,0:17:55.10,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,That would be an absolute suffering.
