Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.08,0:18:00.37,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I can see why there's a lot of skid marks here now,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.37,0:18:03.62,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,everyone's doing their skill- their skill songs here
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.77,0:18:06.58,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,and I'm just gonna donut here...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.82,0:18:09.63,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh dang it, just registered, well that sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.18,0:18:12.73,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we can change car horns now. So, let's-
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.37,0:18:16.53,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,A-... What??? "Anime"
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.65,0:18:18.77,Default Arial/Roboto (Original),,0,0,0,,{\an8}(Piupiupiupiu-wiuuuuuu~)
