Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.20,0:20:24.35,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,for- for- for- for chilling with me
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.35,0:20:26.18,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, be sure to subscribe if you're on YouTube
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.18,0:20:27.57,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,and um...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.57,0:20:29.33,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,be sure to to follow...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.33,0:20:32.10,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, subscribe, bits, whatever if you're on the Twitch side.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.10,0:20:32.95,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.95,0:20:35.78,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,but yeah, I genuinely enjoyed this game
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.78,0:20:38.18,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,so I hope you all do.
